2026-10-23T21:59:06.8811998Z 
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8812088Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8812241Z 
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8812337Z Commands:
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8812635Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8813199Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8813941Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8814612Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8815232Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T21:59:06.8815841Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
